      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Do not** take double the dose of your sumatriptan without first checking the prescribing information or asking a pharmacist or doctor. Taking an extra dose could lead to serious side effects because the maximum safe dose has been established for your medication. If this headache is significantly more intense or different than your usual migraines, seeking professional medical advice is the safest choice. Consider calling your doctor's office for guidance instead of immediately going to the ER.",
      "source": "target",
